WEBVTT

00:00:02.048 --> 00:00:05.848
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.285 --> 00:00:10.119
Todoke Message

00:00:10.523 --> 00:00:19.454
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:20.733
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:28.775
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.775 --> 00:00:29.104
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.308 --> 00:00:36.510
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.883 --> 00:00:41.013
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:45.113
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.424 --> 00:00:49.520
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.695 --> 00:00:53.096
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.432 --> 00:00:57.425
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.737 --> 00:01:01.503
Todoke Message

00:01:01.908 --> 00:01:10.077
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.516 --> 00:01:14.452
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.854 --> 00:01:18.654
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:28.557
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:38.211 --> 00:01:40.076
Are you really sure
about this?

00:01:40.146 --> 00:01:42.671
Yes. Please melt down the key.

00:01:43.015 --> 00:01:44.482
However...!

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:46.845
As you know, I have a bad leg.

00:01:47.587 --> 00:01:49.987
So I'll stay in here and do my work.

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:53.388
Besides, I also have the
Lieutenant Governor's seal here.

00:01:54.327 --> 00:01:58.764
All right. I'll return with
the new governor, without fail.

00:01:59.565 --> 00:02:01.294
Hold on until then.

00:02:12.311 --> 00:02:17.316
While There's Life, There's Hope

00:02:17.316 --> 00:02:18.584
Kiyo

00:02:18.584 --> 00:02:20.186
Kiyo
Sa Province,
where Shurei and Eigetsu...

00:02:20.186 --> 00:02:20.219
Kiyo

00:02:20.219 --> 00:02:21.587
Kiyo
...have been assigned
as co-governors...

00:02:21.587 --> 00:02:22.849
...have been assigned
as co-governors...

00:02:23.256 --> 00:02:25.491
...is currently the most
politically unstable...

00:02:25.491 --> 00:02:25.858
Sa Province / Koren
...is currently the most
politically unstable...

00:02:25.858 --> 00:02:25.892
Sa Province / Koren

00:02:25.892 --> 00:02:29.293
Sa Province / Koren
...of the eight provinces
in Saiunkoku.

00:02:30.329 --> 00:02:32.889
Concerning the petitions Korin brought...

00:02:33.165 --> 00:02:35.861
...it appears that Sa Province is in
even worse condition than we'd thought.

00:02:35.935 --> 00:02:38.733
Yes. Lieutenant Governor Tei...

00:02:39.071 --> 00:02:41.801
...has chosen to enter a prison
built for the worst criminals...

00:02:41.874 --> 00:02:43.933
...and continues to do his work there.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:47.377
The Sa Clan is still unable to obtain
the Lieutenant Governor's seal.

00:02:47.446 --> 00:02:49.710
Therefore the authority of
the Sa provincial government...

00:02:49.782 --> 00:02:51.044
...remains in the
hands of Yushun Tei...

00:02:51.117 --> 00:02:52.914
...and the other provincial
government officials.

00:02:53.152 --> 00:02:55.279
A prison for the worst criminals.

00:02:55.755 --> 00:02:59.555
I understand that Lieutenant Governor
Tei is a very composed, quiet man...

00:02:59.625 --> 00:03:01.820
...who considers matters a great deal.

00:03:01.894 --> 00:03:05.762
Yes, that's right.
But he also has spirit...

00:03:05.831 --> 00:03:08.425
...and when he sets his mind to
something, he goes all out to do it.

00:03:08.501 --> 00:03:09.763
Another skilled individual...

00:03:09.835 --> 00:03:12.963
...who passed the same year as
Senior Secretary Kou and Reishin.

00:03:13.039 --> 00:03:16.202
Yeah, and someone we really
want in the central government.

00:03:16.442 --> 00:03:19.741
How are things with the Sa Clan?
I hear that since Advisor Sa's death...

00:03:19.812 --> 00:03:22.610
...there's been no end to the
fighting among the clan members.

00:03:22.848 --> 00:03:25.408
Not to mention, the ring that is
the symbol of the clan leader...

00:03:25.484 --> 00:03:27.452
...hasn't been found yet, either.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:31.021
Also, how is
Advisor Sa's wife, Lady Eiki?

00:03:31.624 --> 00:03:34.320
I hear that, while Advisor Sa
was here in the Royal Court...

00:03:34.393 --> 00:03:37.453
...that intelligent woman remained in
Sa Province and kept the clan in line.

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.020
Well...!

00:03:39.398 --> 00:03:44.301
Lady Eiki is under guard deep in the
residence and unable to act freely.

00:03:45.905 --> 00:03:47.873
Also, Advisor Sa's
sole granddaughter...

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:50.374
...Shunki, barely managed to escape...

00:03:50.676 --> 00:03:53.042
...and only thanks
to Eiki's quick thinking.

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:56.510
She's currently in hiding
in an undisclosed location.

00:03:56.582 --> 00:04:00.313
For the dauntless Eiki
to be under house arrest...!

00:04:00.987 --> 00:04:03.717
It's not gonna be easy to take office.

00:04:04.223 --> 00:04:07.784
As it was when I took office,
the Sa Clan will undoubtedly...

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:11.487
...send assassins to attack us
on the road to Sa Province.

00:04:12.431 --> 00:04:15.867
Seiran and I will be the only guards, so
as not to attract any attention as we go.

00:04:15.935 --> 00:04:20.099
However, I know you and Seiran
are both very skilled at fighting...

00:04:20.573 --> 00:04:22.063
...but will you be all right?

00:04:22.141 --> 00:04:26.339
We'll protect Princess and Eigetsu,
even if it costs us our lives.

00:04:28.481 --> 00:04:31.678
Take care of the two
new governors, Ensei Ro.

00:04:32.351 --> 00:04:33.511
Yes!

00:04:52.304 --> 00:04:53.771
Father.

00:04:55.174 --> 00:04:57.142
I'm going.

00:05:06.252 --> 00:05:10.052
Shurei, this is your first time
away from Kiyo, isn't it?

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:14.382
Yes. But we've gotta make sure...

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:17.987
...that we get to the Sa provincial
capital, Koren, within three months.

00:05:18.064 --> 00:05:19.395
So, now that we've departed...

00:05:19.465 --> 00:05:21.831
...we have to think of our work
as already having begun.

00:05:22.068 --> 00:05:23.660
That's right.

00:05:23.736 --> 00:05:27.797
Safely taking office is also one
of your responsibilities as governor.

00:05:27.873 --> 00:05:31.400
But normally, it should only take
a month and a half to get there.

00:05:32.011 --> 00:05:34.741
We don't know when pursuers
from the Sa Clan will show up...

00:05:35.448 --> 00:05:39.475
...but what happens if they don't reach
their post within three months?

00:05:39.552 --> 00:05:41.645
They'll be regarded as
having abandoned their post...

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:44.188
...and will automatically be stripped
of their rank as governor.

00:05:44.256 --> 00:05:45.484
No way.

00:05:45.558 --> 00:05:49.426
All the more reason to get to
Koren as quickly as we can!

00:05:49.995 --> 00:05:52.429
All right, that's the spirit,
Princess.

00:06:03.709 --> 00:06:07.702
Come to think of it, this is probably
your first time camping, isn't it Shurei?

00:06:08.214 --> 00:06:13.379
Yes it is, but considering how
dangerous it is, we have no choice.

00:06:13.452 --> 00:06:15.784
Besides, it doesn't hurt to be frugal.

00:06:16.522 --> 00:06:18.786
My Lady, the water's come to a boil.

00:06:19.091 --> 00:06:20.456
Thank you, Seiran.

00:06:23.462 --> 00:06:27.922
I'll take care of it.
Please get some rest, Shurei.

00:06:28.167 --> 00:06:30.135
Oh, thank you.

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:37.131
Um, Shurei. Thank you very much
for allowing me to accompany you.

00:06:44.216 --> 00:06:47.811
That's why Korin... poisoned you.

00:06:55.027 --> 00:06:56.494
Korin.

00:07:18.951 --> 00:07:21.886
Darn. If this is how things
are on day one...

00:07:21.954 --> 00:07:24.047
...it's troubling to think
what lies ahead.

00:07:26.125 --> 00:07:28.184
Here you go, Princess.
A present.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:30.160
Thanks so much. This will really help.

00:07:33.365 --> 00:07:35.492
How did things go with our pursuers?

00:07:35.568 --> 00:07:39.902
I took care of them.
I think we should be okay for now.

00:07:39.972 --> 00:07:41.701
So they came, as expected.

00:07:41.774 --> 00:07:43.207
Yeah.

00:07:43.275 --> 00:07:46.608
After all, having the new governors arrive
would cause problems for those guys.

00:07:47.046 --> 00:07:50.880
Things are gonna get more severe
from here on, Mr. Special Officer.

00:07:52.218 --> 00:07:55.654
I'll do whatever it takes
to keep her ladyship safe.

00:07:56.155 --> 00:08:21.538
Koku Province / Shi Province / Kiyo

00:08:23.415 --> 00:08:25.178
It's been a month since we left Kiyo.

00:08:25.251 --> 00:08:27.651
We haven't come into town like
this for a while, have we?

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.017
That's true.

00:08:29.088 --> 00:08:32.080
Since we have the chance,
shall we stop and rest somewhere?

00:08:32.558 --> 00:08:34.082
Let's do that.

00:08:34.159 --> 00:08:37.151
After all, there don't seem to be any
pursuers from the Sa Clan in this town.

00:08:37.529 --> 00:08:38.928
A kidnapper!

00:08:39.965 --> 00:08:41.023
A kidnapper?!

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.000
- What's going on?!
- Catch him!

00:08:43.068 --> 00:08:45.696
- He's gone that way!
- Hey, catch the guy!

00:08:45.771 --> 00:08:47.329
Wait!

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:53.742
You're wrong! You're mistaken!
You're misunderstanding!

00:08:53.812 --> 00:08:55.871
Um, well, it's all a mistake!

00:08:56.515 --> 00:08:58.608
- Ensei.
- That fool.

00:08:58.984 --> 00:09:00.110
Ah, Korin.

00:09:01.153 --> 00:09:03.121
Father, what's the matter?

00:09:05.124 --> 00:09:06.421
Father?

00:09:06.492 --> 00:09:10.519
Yes, he is my father. And the one
he's carrying is my younger brother.

00:09:10.596 --> 00:09:12.587
What do you want with my father
and younger brother?

00:09:12.665 --> 00:09:15.896
O-Oh, is that so?
I thought it was a kidnapping.

00:09:16.635 --> 00:09:18.102
Oh, boy.

00:09:24.777 --> 00:09:27.337
I was worried how things
would turn out back there.

00:09:28.047 --> 00:09:32.484
In any case, just how did you manage
to be mistaken for a kidnapper?

00:09:32.718 --> 00:09:35.084
I'm sorry, it was my fault.

00:09:36.522 --> 00:09:38.581
I saw some books
on medicinal herbs...

00:09:38.657 --> 00:09:40.420
...that I'd never seen before
in a used bookstore...

00:09:40.492 --> 00:09:43.290
...and since they were
on an upper shelf...!

00:09:43.362 --> 00:09:48.197
I figured it would be difficult for him to
see, so I lifted him up. And when I did...!

00:09:48.267 --> 00:09:49.962
A kidnapper!

00:09:51.036 --> 00:09:54.665
But Miss Korin's quick thinking saved us.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:57.875
Very true.
Thank you, Korin.

00:09:57.943 --> 00:10:00.241
I'm glad you came with us.

00:10:01.146 --> 00:10:03.376
N-No, you're too kind.

00:10:04.016 --> 00:10:09.283
But still, coming up with that idea on
the spot like that is really something.

00:10:09.588 --> 00:10:12.250
It's because you took it upon
yourself to do something unnecessary.

00:10:12.324 --> 00:10:14.258
Try being a bit more repentant.

00:10:14.827 --> 00:10:16.522
I-I'm sorry.

00:10:16.595 --> 00:10:20.463
Eigetsu has apologized,
so go easy on him.

00:10:22.468 --> 00:10:24.698
If you say so, Shurei.

00:10:28.841 --> 00:10:32.538
Excuse me, could you please stop
the carriage for a moment somewhere?

00:10:34.947 --> 00:10:36.881
Korin. Take this.

00:10:37.216 --> 00:10:40.185
What is this suspicious-looking pill?

00:10:40.252 --> 00:10:42.311
It appears that you have
a bit of a fever...

00:10:42.388 --> 00:10:44.583
...so you should take this
before it gets any worse.

00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:49.985
We've been camping outside continually,
so it's no wonder you're becoming weak.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.889
This is quite a fever.

00:10:53.966 --> 00:10:56.457
Korin. Why didn't you say
something sooner?

00:10:57.069 --> 00:11:00.163
It's nothing serious.
I can handle it.

00:11:00.706 --> 00:11:02.640
Please, Miss Korin.

00:11:02.708 --> 00:11:05.541
If you're feeling weak,
you've gotta tell us right away.

00:11:05.911 --> 00:11:09.312
If you push yourself too much and get
worse, you'll become a burden to us.

00:11:09.381 --> 00:11:11.406
I'm very sorry.

00:11:12.251 --> 00:11:16.085
Still, the one who's feeling ill and
suffering the most right now is you, Korin.

00:11:16.555 --> 00:11:17.920
Now, please take this.

00:11:19.658 --> 00:11:21.626
Seiran. Where are you going?

00:11:22.027 --> 00:11:24.757
I'll go on ahead a little
and check things out.

00:11:25.364 --> 00:11:28.925
The town of Sakyo should be
at the base of this mountain.

00:11:30.736 --> 00:11:33.603
Seiran is pretty cool,
don't you think?

00:11:33.672 --> 00:11:35.037
Yes.

00:11:35.107 --> 00:11:38.270
He's very different from you,
a bit of a bonehead.

00:11:41.814 --> 00:11:43.213
True.

00:11:43.549 --> 00:11:44.675
This is bitter.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.843
Ah, I-I'm sorry.

00:11:47.986 --> 00:11:50.113
We'll get a room for tonight.

00:11:51.156 --> 00:11:56.116
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:12:07.339 --> 00:12:12.072
Eigetsu. I'll take over for a while.
You need to get some rest, too.

00:12:12.511 --> 00:12:16.811
In that case, here. Please have
Korin take this when she wakes up.

00:12:17.449 --> 00:12:18.746
I'll do that.

00:12:23.689 --> 00:12:25.657
I'm sorry. Did I wake you?

00:12:25.724 --> 00:12:26.816
Shurei.

00:12:28.961 --> 00:12:30.986
No, you need to rest some more.

00:12:31.063 --> 00:12:34.464
I'm so sorry, Shurei.

00:12:34.533 --> 00:12:37.525
Don't worry about it.
On the contrary...

00:12:37.603 --> 00:12:40.834
...it's my fault for deciding to camp
outside all this time.

00:12:42.074 --> 00:12:43.336
I'm sorry.

00:12:43.408 --> 00:12:46.673
- No, you're mistaken.
- In any case, get some rest.

00:12:47.312 --> 00:12:50.509
Right now, you must concentrate
only on getting better.

00:12:51.316 --> 00:12:53.284
I'm sorry.

00:12:55.454 --> 00:12:57.854
Get better quickly, Korin.

00:13:03.629 --> 00:13:05.654
I'm... so sorry.

00:13:05.731 --> 00:13:07.926
You don't need to apologize
so much like that.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:12.767
I have no right to be treated
so well by you, Shurei.

00:13:13.105 --> 00:13:14.402
What are you talking about?

00:13:14.473 --> 00:13:18.967
There's something that
I must apologize to you for.

00:13:19.611 --> 00:13:21.670
About the incident one year ago.

00:13:23.782 --> 00:13:25.943
It was all my doing.

00:13:35.761 --> 00:13:38.889
My Lady, how is Korin feeling?

00:13:42.034 --> 00:13:45.902
It seems that the stress from this trip
has taken a toll on her. Where's Ensei?

00:13:49.074 --> 00:13:50.200
Damn it!

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:58.078
He left earlier, saying he was going
to see how things were in town.

00:13:58.383 --> 00:14:00.977
Perhaps he's been mistaken
for a kidnapper again?

00:14:01.453 --> 00:14:04.513
Seiran. That's not funny.

00:14:05.123 --> 00:14:07.557
But it's because of that beard, isn't it?

00:14:07.626 --> 00:14:09.526
That's why I keep telling
him to shave it off.

00:14:09.595 --> 00:14:13.361
But we might not have made it this far
without anyone figuring out who we are...

00:14:13.432 --> 00:14:16.765
...if Ensei, as our coachman,
didn't have that appearance.

00:14:17.703 --> 00:14:21.537
I'm afraid, no matter how hard I tried...

00:14:21.707 --> 00:14:24.835
...I couldn't grow a beard that would
make me look nearly as suspicious.

00:14:25.277 --> 00:14:27.245
Seiran with a beard.

00:14:32.184 --> 00:14:35.950
But we can't always
impose on Ensei like this.

00:14:36.455 --> 00:14:41.051
He's your assistant, My Lady.
It's his job to be imposed upon.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.461
Besides, he doesn't think
of it as an imposition.

00:14:44.896 --> 00:14:45.954
I see.

00:14:48.367 --> 00:14:50.335
And of course, neither do I.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.768
That's been the case since long ago.

00:14:54.039 --> 00:14:57.475
But maybe I should say it now,
that I'm sorry.

00:14:59.511 --> 00:15:03.811
Not to worry. It all gets written off
by a single cup of tea made by you.

00:15:06.885 --> 00:15:10.252
Come to think of it, the tea in
this area is sweet, isn't it?

00:15:10.322 --> 00:15:13.985
I believe it's called Gan Lu tea.

00:15:14.259 --> 00:15:17.160
It's the first time
I've ever had such sweet tea.

00:15:17.229 --> 00:15:19.424
It's not at all heavy
and is really delicious.

00:15:21.266 --> 00:15:23.234
It's not your first time.

00:15:23.535 --> 00:15:26.060
We've had it in the past
when we came by this way...

00:15:26.138 --> 00:15:28.333
...and you liked this tea
very much.

00:15:28.407 --> 00:15:29.431
You're kidding!

00:15:29.508 --> 00:15:30.907
It's true.

00:15:30.976 --> 00:15:33.308
When you were two or three...

00:15:33.378 --> 00:15:36.040
...you wanted it even more than food,
and would insist on it.

00:15:36.114 --> 00:15:40.016
Come to think of it,
we met you in Sa Province, didn't we?

00:15:40.218 --> 00:15:42.345
Father told me so before.

00:15:46.224 --> 00:15:47.316
Seiran.

00:15:47.392 --> 00:15:50.691
I'm really happy
that you came with us.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:56.524
I'm the special guard assigned to you
and Eigetsu, so it's only natural.

00:15:57.502 --> 00:15:59.936
True, but that's not what I mean.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:04.670
Now that I've become an official...

00:16:04.743 --> 00:16:09.703
...I thought I had prepared myself to be
sent out to any region or post on my own.

00:16:11.516 --> 00:16:14.110
Your life is your own, Seiran.

00:16:14.586 --> 00:16:17.054
In actuality, you could choose
any path that you wanted.

00:16:17.756 --> 00:16:22.750
Even so, His Majesty bestowed
a sword on you and you stayed with me.

00:16:23.729 --> 00:16:25.663
I'm really happy about that.

00:16:25.731 --> 00:16:28.598
I don't know what happened
in the past in Sa Province...

00:16:28.834 --> 00:16:30.995
...and if you don't wanna
talk about it, I won't ask.

00:16:33.939 --> 00:16:36.737
Just as you always take care of me...

00:16:37.509 --> 00:16:39.909
...I'm also watching out for you.

00:16:40.479 --> 00:16:43.607
So, for starters, don't hold
yourself back because of me.

00:16:44.483 --> 00:16:48.510
It's okay to look gloomy, and show me
that you're worried about something.

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.754
It's not that I don't
want to go to Sa Province.

00:16:55.961 --> 00:17:00.830
After all, that's the place where
I met Master, Madam, and you.

00:17:01.767 --> 00:17:05.066
It's just that I haven't finished
sorting out my feelings.

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:10.533
So, until I do,
I might look a little gloomy.

00:17:11.676 --> 00:17:16.613
At times like that, will you make
some Gan Lu tea and have it with me?

00:17:17.182 --> 00:17:19.116
That's it?

00:17:20.118 --> 00:17:21.449
Yes.

00:17:21.787 --> 00:17:25.689
All right. In that case,
I need to buy lots of Gan Lu tea.

00:17:25.757 --> 00:17:27.156
It's expensive.

00:17:27.225 --> 00:17:28.385
Silly.

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:31.793
If that's the price of making
you feel better, it's cheap.

00:17:32.764 --> 00:17:33.753
And?

00:17:33.832 --> 00:17:37.165
How much longer do you intend on
standing there eavesdropping, Ensei?

00:17:37.235 --> 00:17:39.396
- Hi! I'm back!
- I'm sorry.

00:17:39.471 --> 00:17:43.168
It was such a nice scene,
so I thought it would be rude to intrude.

00:17:43.241 --> 00:17:44.333
Likewise.

00:17:44.409 --> 00:17:48.209
Welcome back, Ensei.
Would the two of you like some tea?

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:49.611
