- Yeah!

00:17:50.182 --> 00:17:53.618
You know, you're really very kind
when it's just you and Princess...

00:17:53.685 --> 00:17:55.175
...aren't you, Seiran?

00:17:55.821 --> 00:17:57.948
The only time you appear
to have a good personality...

00:17:58.023 --> 00:18:00.924
...is when you're with Princess
or Mr. Shoka, isn't it?

00:18:00.992 --> 00:18:04.689
Oh, I'll also make you some
Gan Lu tea and have it with you.

00:18:05.197 --> 00:18:07.529
In your case, you'd be
unwanted company, you fool.

00:18:07.599 --> 00:18:12.627
- Man, that's mean.
I just wanna support you.
- He knew Seiran before coming
to live with us.

00:18:12.704 --> 00:18:17.004
- I'd rather befriend the locusts
than get your support.
- Could Sa Province be where
these two met?

00:18:19.411 --> 00:18:21.980
Now then, we've had breakfast,
so let's get started.

