office. The same as Princess is now.

00:18:55.046 --> 00:18:56.013
Seventeen?!

00:18:56.081 --> 00:18:57.378
Yeah, seventeen.

00:18:57.449 --> 00:19:00.418
You know, you're probably
about the only one who's been...

00:19:00.485 --> 00:19:03.648
...the governor of the same
province for almost ten years.

00:19:04.856 --> 00:19:07.324
I was simply forgotten about
by the central government...

00:19:07.392 --> 00:19:09.189
...during the fight for the throne.

00:19:09.394 --> 00:19:12.124
Considering the fact that Sa Province
is plagued by endless problems...

00:19:12.197 --> 00:19:14.427
...how did you keep things
so under control...

00:19:14.499 --> 00:19:15.864
...that the court forgot about you?

00:19:15.934 --> 00:19:18.232
Now that you mention it,
good point.

00:19:18.303 --> 00:19:20.396
You're really something, Mr. Ensei.

00:19:22.274 --> 00:19:26.574
