of the guard station until summer passes.

00:19:59.444 --> 00:20:03.244
In other words, until the end of
our window to take office, right?

00:20:04.049 --> 00:20:06.017
Shall we split up, after all?

00:20:06.751 --> 00:20:11.688
We have no other choice, do we?
After all, I'm famous in Sa Province.

00:20:12.157 --> 00:20:14.216
If I were with Princess and the gang...

00:20:14.292 --> 00:20:17.022
...I'd be practically telling them that
these are the two new governors.

00:20:17.095 --> 00:20:19.029
The risk of being discovered
is extremely high.

00:20:19.664 --> 00:20:23.259
And so we'll go over the details later...

00:20:23.401 --> 00:20:26.165
