00:20:48.893 --> 00:20:50.861
I-I agree.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:56.792
Korin.

00:20:57.002 --> 00:21:02.406
Shurei. I'm so sorry.
It seems I've slept an awful long time.

00:21:03.174 --> 00:21:06.337
Your face is still a bit flushed.
You need to sleep some more.

00:21:06.745 --> 00:21:09.873
No. Thanks to you,
I'm feeling much better now.

00:21:11.883 --> 00:21:13.441
Korin?

00:21:13.518 --> 00:21:16.009
I know what I've done is unforgivable...

00:21:16.187 --> 00:21:20.851
