to accompany you?

00:21:43.681 --> 00:21:47.879
Because I still like you, Korin.

00:21:50.088 --> 00:21:52.147
Sh-Shurei.

00:21:53.625 --> 00:21:55.923
Thank you for talking to me about it.

00:21:56.461 --> 00:21:58.122
Shurei.

00:21:59.898 --> 00:22:05.837
Once I've formally taken office as
governor, please stay by my side, okay?

00:22:06.805 --> 00:22:07.794
Yes!

00:22:07.872 --> 00:22:12.866
Even if it means my life,
I will absolutely keep you safe!

00:22:14.379 --> 00:22:17.075
Don't waste your life on me.

00:22:18.783 --> 00:22:22.810
Like they say, "while there's life,
there's hope", right? Okay?

00:22:24.322 --> 00:22:25.812
Shurei.

00:22:31.229 --> 00:22:32.423
